  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bò nướng lá lốt are logs of spiced beef wrapped in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "la-lot"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "lá lốt "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "betel leaves and grilled quickly over high heat. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The leaves char and flavour the beef as it cooks. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe makes about 20 rolls, enough for 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Betel leaves can be found at Asian supermarkets. If unavailable, grape leaves make a reasonable substitute for wrapping, though the flavour will be milder."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
